This Bill is to provide for establishment of the al-BiruniInternationalUniversity,IslamabadinthePrivatesector.ThePrincipalseat of the University shall be at Islamabad and it shall set up itscampuses in Jhelum, Abbottabad' Gilgit' Gujjar Khan including at allsuch places in Pakistan and abroad as the Board of the Universrty maydetermine from time to time' The purposes of the University inter-aliashall be advancing knowledge' fostering critical thinking andcontributing to the betterment of society'The Bill is designed to achieve the abovementioned objectives'
