21. Academic Council - The Academic Council shal1 consist of:-
(a)(b)(c)(d)(e)(0
The Vice Chancellor;A11 the Deans;A11 the Head of the DePartments;Three Prot'essors of the University to be nominated by the Chairman;Registrar;ThJ Director Academics of the University, who will also act as the
