CHAPTERNIPATRON AND OFFICERS OF THE UNTVERSITY9. Patron.-(1) The President of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan shall be the Patron of theUniversity.(2) The Patron shall, when present, preside at the convocation of the Universityor may authorize the Chancellor or any other person of eminence to presideover the convocation of the University.10. Principal oflicers. - The following shall be the principal officers ofthe University, namely:(u) the Chancellor;(b) the Pro Chancellor;(c) theVice-chancellor;(d) the Deans;(e) the Registrar;(f) the Treasurer;(g) the Controller of Examinations; and(h) such other persons as prescribed by the Statutes, Regulations or Rulesto be the principal officers of the University-
