CIIAPTER-TITHE UNIVERSITY
3. Establishment and Incorporation of the University'-(l) There shall be established a university to be called al-Biruni IntemationalUniversity,locatedatlslamabad,intheprivatesector,consistingof:(i) the Patron, Chancellor, Pro Chancellor, Vice Chancellor' members oftheBoard,theDeans,theTeachersandsuchotherofficersandmembersof the staff as may be prescribed from time to time;(ii) the members of such councils, committees, and other bodies as theBoard may establish or authorize from time to time; and(iii)themembersofthefaculties,departmentsandstudentsoftheColleges,schools, and lnstitutes.(Z) The University shall be a body corporate by the name of al-BirLrniInternationalUniversity,havingperpetualsuccessionandacommonseal'with power, among others, to acquire and hold property' and to lease' sell orotherwise transfer any movable and immovable property and investments'whichmayhavebecomevestedinorbeacquiredbyitandshallbythesaidname sue and be sued.(3) The principal seat of the University shall be at Islamabad and it shall set upits campuses in Jhelum, Abbottabad, Gilgit, Gujar Khan including at all suchplaces in Pakistan, and abroad, as the Board may determine from time totime.(4) Notwithstanding anything contained in any other law for the time being inforce, the University shall have academic, financial and administrativeautonomy,includingthepowertoemployofficers,Teachersandotheremployees on such terms as may be prescribed'
4

